1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 35]</font>

15
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:17,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's you I meant to slap.</font>

16
00:01:18,320 --> 00:01:18,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao!</font>

17
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:35,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

18
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:36,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let her go.</font>

19
00:01:43,240 --> 00:01:43,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you alright?</font>

20
00:01:47,160 --> 00:01:48,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan, are you alright?</font>

21
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:52,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

22
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:54,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao must have lost his mind.</font>

23
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That demoness has bewitched him.</font>

24
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

25
00:01:58,560 --> 00:01:59,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I could see it.</font>

26
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He was in great pain.</font>

27
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He didn't truly want to hurt me.</font>

28
00:02:04,440 --> 00:02:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan, what are you saying?</font>

29
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:06,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you out of your mind?</font>

30
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I had known,</font>

31
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:11,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd have just knocked him out
and taken him.</font>

32
00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:12,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

33
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:15,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then let's knock him out and take him.</font>

34
00:02:30,080 --> 00:02:30,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should rest now.</font>

35
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:31,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take my leave.</font>

36
00:02:37,320 --> 00:02:38,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be so reckless in the future.</font>

37
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:41,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After all,
she is the Fourth Prince's sister.</font>

38
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:43,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Close your eyes now.</font>

39
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:52,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady.</font>

40
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:54,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've brought your medicine.</font>

41
00:02:58,320 --> 00:02:59,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll keep watch outside.</font>

42
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every single time.</font>

43
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:07,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're doing this on purpose.</font>

44
00:03:08,720 --> 00:03:09,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are the sacred maid.</font>

45
00:03:09,720 --> 00:03:10,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before you are wed,</font>

46
00:03:10,760 --> 00:03:12,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you must keep a proper distance</font>

47
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:13,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from Lord Ruling.</font>

48
00:03:13,440 --> 00:03:14,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This title of sacred maid</font>

49
00:03:15,320 --> 00:03:16,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is just a shell for the Chengtian Sect.</font>

50
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:18,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">An empty facade.</font>

51
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:19,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd rather be rid of it.</font>

52
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You mustn't say that.</font>

53
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:22,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If the Grandlord finds out,</font>

54
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:23,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he will be furious.</font>

55
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Apply the medicine now.</font>

56
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:49,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yaoji says you're
the Fourth Prince's sister.</font>

57
00:03:49,760 --> 00:03:50,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She forbade me from harming you.</font>

58
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:52,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I'm warning you:</font>

59
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the last time.</font>

60
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our pain is linked.</font>

61
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:01,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurting me is hurting yourself.</font>

62
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:02,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you kill me,</font>

63
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll die too.</font>

64
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:07,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, the catalyst is with you.</font>

65
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You forget about me,</font>

66
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet you remember this clearly.</font>

67
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:15,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm warning you:</font>

68
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:17,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay away from that demoness.</font>

69
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No intimacy with her.</font>

70
00:04:21,080 --> 00:04:23,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Or I'll stab myself with this hairpin.</font>

71
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:26,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'll share my agony.</font>

72
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:37,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Chengtian Sect]</font>

73
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll kill her.</font>

74
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:39,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must not.</font>

75
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:41,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She is the catalyst.</font>

76
00:04:41,080 --> 00:04:42,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If she dies, there's no antidote.</font>

77
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:44,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rather than be her puppet,</font>

78
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:46,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd rather we die together.</font>

79
00:04:46,840 --> 00:04:47,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Rest assured.</font>

80
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:49,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She'll cure your Bloodlure Poison.</font>

81
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:51,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you just follow my plan,</font>

82
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:53,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll be free of that woman for good.</font>

83
00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:55,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then,</font>

84
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no one will stand in our way.</font>

85
00:05:03,280 --> 00:05:03,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

86
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:33,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dear, why such discourtesy?</font>

87
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:38,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

88
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:40,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't mean to.</font>

89
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:42,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was waiting up for you last night.</font>

90
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:43,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come down here and speak.</font>

91
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:49,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

92
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:52,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have I done something wrong?</font>

93
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:53,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can tell me.</font>

94
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I swear I will change.</font>

95
00:05:56,760 --> 00:05:58,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dress properly and mind your manners.</font>

96
00:05:59,320 --> 00:06:00,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will find a Discipline Matron tomorrow</font>

97
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:02,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and send her to your chambers.</font>

98
00:06:02,760 --> 00:06:04,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you truly wish to improve,</font>

99
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:06,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">learn the rules well from the matron.</font>

100
00:06:08,920 --> 00:06:11,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai, there's no need for a matron.</font>

101
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:14,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai, you could teach me yourself.</font>

102
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll surely study hard.</font>

103
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:17,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

104
00:06:18,520 --> 00:06:20,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then today,
I'll teach you the first lesson.</font>

105
00:06:23,280 --> 00:06:24,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll start by teaching you how to walk.</font>

106
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:26,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stand up straight.</font>

107
00:06:26,760 --> 00:06:27,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Turn to the right.</font>

108
00:06:29,840 --> 00:06:30,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Walk to the door.</font>

109
00:06:38,880 --> 00:06:39,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here?</font>

110
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:41,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Step outside.</font>

111
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:44,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The left foot or the right foot?</font>

112
00:06:44,440 --> 00:06:44,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The right foot.</font>

113
00:06:49,880 --> 00:06:50,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take one more step forward.</font>

114
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:57,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dear, you may return now.</font>

115
00:06:58,480 --> 00:07:00,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai, open the door!</font>

116
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:01,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai!</font>

117
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:04,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm the Beiyuan consort here
for the alliance.</font>

118
00:07:05,400 --> 00:07:06,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your indifference to me</font>

119
00:07:07,200 --> 00:07:09,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is an indifference to Beiyuan.</font>

120
00:07:09,760 --> 00:07:12,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this how Xizhao treats its guests?</font>

121
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:14,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I dare you to come out and tell me</font>

122
00:07:14,520 --> 00:07:15,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how to reach your Imperial Palace.</font>

123
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:17,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm going to complain
to the Great Emperor.</font>

124
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:20,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't believe me? I'll really go.</font>

125
00:07:23,320 --> 00:07:23,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go, then.</font>

126
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You always pick on me.</font>

127
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just complaining.</font>

128
00:07:40,440 --> 00:07:41,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My status is special.</font>

129
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:43,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't be seen in public.</font>

130
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:46,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please forgive me, Miss Qin.</font>

131
00:07:46,280 --> 00:07:47,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Say what you came to say.</font>

132
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:48,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Qin,</font>

133
00:07:49,200 --> 00:07:50,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">regarding the Bloodlure Poison,</font>

134
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:52,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling has told me everything.</font>

135
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:53,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And so?</font>

136
00:07:54,400 --> 00:07:56,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No matter how this poison was planted,</font>

137
00:07:57,560 --> 00:08:00,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling won't be entangled
with an outsider</font>

138
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:01,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in such a connection.</font>

139
00:08:02,080 --> 00:08:04,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So please cooperate, Miss Qin,</font>

140
00:08:05,520 --> 00:08:07,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to neutralize the Bloodlure Poison.</font>

141
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:08,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Bloodlure Poison can be cured?</font>

142
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every cause has its effect.</font>

143
00:08:10,760 --> 00:08:12,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once the Bloodlure Poison
enters the body,</font>

144
00:08:12,520 --> 00:08:13,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">whether as poison or catalyst,</font>

145
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:15,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they resonate with each other.</font>

146
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:17,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our sect has a way to cure it.</font>

147
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:18,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Qin, I believe</font>

148
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:20,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll agree.</font>

149
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:22,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why would I ever agree?</font>

150
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The poison is in his body,</font>

151
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:25,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the antidote is in mine.</font>

152
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:27,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This only benefits me.</font>

153
00:08:28,080 --> 00:08:28,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There is no downside.</font>

154
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:30,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I knew you had ill intentions.</font>

155
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:32,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want Ruling so badly</font>

156
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:34,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you'd use this to control him.</font>

157
00:08:34,920 --> 00:08:35,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you:</font>

158
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:37,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That will never happen.</font>

159
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:39,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He'd rather die than be your puppet.</font>

160
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:42,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you truly want to drive him to death?</font>

161
00:08:43,400 --> 00:08:44,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If he dies,</font>

162
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:46,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will die with him.</font>

163
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:49,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you?</font>

164
00:08:50,400 --> 00:08:51,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will you join us?</font>

165
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:53,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In life</font>

166
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:54,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or in death,</font>

167
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:58,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">his heart belongs only to me.</font>

168
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Qin,</font>

169
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:04,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why make a fool of yourself</font>

170
00:09:04,760 --> 00:09:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and invite such humiliation?</font>

171
00:09:10,960 --> 00:09:12,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just tell me</font>

172
00:09:12,880 --> 00:09:14,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what exactly you did to him.</font>

173
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:16,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can promise you.</font>

174
00:09:25,160 --> 00:09:26,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is called</font>

175
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:30,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Heart-Devouring Poison.</font>

176
00:09:34,960 --> 00:09:36,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It means no future for you two.</font>

177
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:38,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, don't waste your effort.</font>

178
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:41,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you agree to lift
the Bloodlure Poison,</font>

179
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:44,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you still have five days together.</font>

180
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:47,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think it over carefully.</font>

181
00:09:58,120 --> 00:10:00,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Medical texts]</font>

182
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:18,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Another dead end.</font>

183
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:20,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All that rambling before</font>

184
00:10:20,520 --> 00:10:21,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is complete nonsense.</font>

185
00:10:23,040 --> 00:10:23,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

186
00:10:24,280 --> 00:10:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xizhao's records
on the Heart-Devouring Poison</font>

187
00:10:26,240 --> 00:10:26,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are all right here.</font>

188
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Should I ask around the Palace again?</font>

189
00:10:30,640 --> 00:10:31,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

190
00:10:31,640 --> 00:10:33,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">every move you make now</font>

191
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:34,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can be twisted by those with ill intent.</font>

192
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:37,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should stay out of this.</font>

193
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:39,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know the human body best.</font>

194
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:42,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">While the heart beats
and the mind is sound,</font>

195
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:45,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how can such a poison
control anyone forever?</font>

196
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:48,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince and I
have been through so much.</font>

197
00:10:49,040 --> 00:10:51,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can a mere poison</font>

198
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:53,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">make him forget our entire past?</font>

199
00:10:54,800 --> 00:10:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then what do you plan to do?</font>

200
00:10:58,360 --> 00:10:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll agree to Yaoji's terms.</font>

201
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:02,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

202
00:11:02,680 --> 00:11:05,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">send word to Yaoji at Chengtian Sect.</font>

203
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:08,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will help her lift
the Bloodlure Poison,</font>

204
00:11:08,640 --> 00:11:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but the Prince must come
and stay with me.</font>

205
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:12,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No guards or followers.</font>

206
00:11:13,560 --> 00:11:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You intend</font>

207
00:11:14,880 --> 00:11:15,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to use this chance to heal him.</font>

208
00:11:16,960 --> 00:11:18,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As long as his heart still beats,</font>

209
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:20,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will make him remember me.</font>

210
00:11:30,800 --> 00:11:31,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's begin.</font>

211
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:35,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Qin,</font>

212
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:38,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if not for Ruling,</font>

213
00:11:38,560 --> 00:11:40,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would never agree to your terms.</font>

214
00:11:41,040 --> 00:11:42,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These five days, care for him well.</font>

215
00:11:43,640 --> 00:11:45,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep your distance. Observe in silence.</font>

216
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:48,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you certain, My Lady?</font>

217
00:11:48,640 --> 00:11:50,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't come begging
for him again later.</font>

218
00:11:51,400 --> 00:11:52,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A brief parting</font>

219
00:11:53,280 --> 00:11:54,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is for a better reunion.</font>

220
00:11:56,400 --> 00:11:57,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have faith in him.</font>

221
00:12:03,920 --> 00:12:05,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you really that confident?</font>

222
00:12:06,160 --> 00:12:06,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't touch me.</font>

223
00:12:07,520 --> 00:12:08,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling,</font>

224
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:09,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can't handle it already?</font>

225
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:12,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How will we get along after this?</font>

226
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:14,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I warn you: Don't try any tricks.</font>

227
00:12:15,680 --> 00:12:16,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be with you these five days.</font>

228
00:12:18,680 --> 00:12:19,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But nothing more than that.</font>

229
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:23,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me. What exactly must we do?</font>

230
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:24,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It can't be</font>

231
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:27,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as simple as five days together.</font>

232
00:12:31,560 --> 00:12:33,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This cord is called Thousand Knots.</font>

233
00:12:33,640 --> 00:12:34,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's coated with a special antidote</font>

234
00:12:34,800 --> 00:12:36,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that can neutralize
the Bloodlure Poison.</font>

235
00:12:37,040 --> 00:12:37,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For these five days,</font>

236
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:40,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you must each tie this cord</font>

237
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:41,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">around one of your wrists.</font>

238
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:44,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By Day 5, the cord snaps,
and the poison lifts.</font>

239
00:12:45,360 --> 00:12:47,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If it's untied or broken midway,</font>

240
00:12:48,040 --> 00:12:50,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the poison will worsen for both of you.</font>

241
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:52,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Qin.</font>

242
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:55,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First, make a cut on the left wrist.</font>

243
00:13:05,640 --> 00:13:06,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you need my help?</font>

244
00:13:14,400 --> 00:13:14,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling.</font>

245
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:16,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is hard on you.</font>

246
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:18,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's nothing.</font>

247
00:13:18,800 --> 00:13:20,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry up and tie the rope.</font>

248
00:13:20,640 --> 00:13:21,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Soon we'll bleed out</font>

249
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:22,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and have to be cut again.</font>

250
00:13:39,200 --> 00:13:40,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is there anything else, My Lady?</font>

251
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:43,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If there's nothing else,</font>

252
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:44,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'll take our leave.</font>

253
00:13:45,520 --> 00:13:46,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Goodbye then.</font>

254
00:14:00,280 --> 00:14:00,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These five days,</font>

255
00:14:01,160 --> 00:14:02,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want to see them again.</font>

256
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:04,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll see whomever I please.</font>

257
00:14:04,520 --> 00:14:05,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not your concern.</font>

258
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:11,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These five days,</font>

259
00:14:12,040 --> 00:14:13,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">three days are mine; two are yours.</font>

260
00:14:14,400 --> 00:14:15,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whatever one party does,</font>

261
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:18,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the other must comply and not interfere.</font>

262
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:21,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do you get one more day than me?</font>

263
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:25,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because I dare to break it right now.</font>

264
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:29,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

265
00:14:30,160 --> 00:14:30,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As you wish.</font>

266
00:14:34,640 --> 00:14:35,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's sleep.</font>

267
00:14:38,160 --> 00:14:39,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're tied together with this rope.</font>

268
00:14:40,080 --> 00:14:41,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do I have to sleep on the floor?</font>

269
00:14:43,240 --> 00:14:44,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't have the habit
of indulging women.</font>

270
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:46,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

271
00:14:48,800 --> 00:14:49,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

272
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:53,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's going on here?</font>

273
00:14:55,920 --> 00:14:57,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He wants to sleep on the floor.</font>

274
00:14:57,400 --> 00:14:58,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But the rope isn't long enough.</font>

275
00:14:59,080 --> 00:14:59,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It probably won't work.</font>

276
00:15:00,560 --> 00:15:01,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came precisely for this matter.</font>

277
00:15:02,160 --> 00:15:03,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've figured it out for you both.</font>

278
00:15:03,800 --> 00:15:04,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll draw a line.</font>

279
00:15:05,160 --> 00:15:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Neither of you touches the other.</font>

280
00:15:09,280 --> 00:15:09,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

281
00:15:10,480 --> 00:15:11,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are already husband and wife.</font>

282
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:13,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need for such formalities.</font>

283
00:15:13,480 --> 00:15:14,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since when are we husband and wife?</font>

284
00:15:15,560 --> 00:15:16,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With that figure of yours,</font>

285
00:15:17,800 --> 00:15:19,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what blind fool would fancy you?</font>

286
00:15:19,680 --> 00:15:20,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

287
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:21,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Watch your tongue.</font>

288
00:15:22,400 --> 00:15:23,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't think your amnesia</font>

289
00:15:23,640 --> 00:15:24,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">lets you do as you please.</font>

290
00:15:24,880 --> 00:15:26,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is my residence, after all.</font>

291
00:15:26,400 --> 00:15:27,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She is my sister.</font>

292
00:15:28,200 --> 00:15:29,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you dare lay a hand on her,</font>

293
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:30,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will not let you off.</font>

294
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:32,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should be telling her that.</font>

295
00:15:33,960 --> 00:15:34,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

296
00:15:35,080 --> 00:15:36,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you've had a long day.</font>

297
00:15:36,560 --> 00:15:37,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please go and rest now.</font>

298
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:48,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can we sleep properly now?</font>

299
00:16:02,640 --> 00:16:03,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

300
00:16:04,480 --> 00:16:06,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have you truly forgotten</font>

301
00:16:07,040 --> 00:16:08,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our past?</font>

302
00:17:00,720 --> 00:17:01,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These five days and nights,</font>

303
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:04,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we can't avoid each other.</font>

304
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:07,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I fear I can't help but slit her throat.</font>

305
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:11,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ruling,</font>

306
00:17:12,360 --> 00:17:13,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know you have feelings for me.</font>

307
00:17:14,440 --> 00:17:15,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want to send you</font>

308
00:17:16,360 --> 00:17:17,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to her side.</font>

309
00:17:17,760 --> 00:17:18,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But in my heart,</font>

310
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:21,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your life matters above all else.</font>

311
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:27,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Thousand Knots</font>

312
00:17:27,880 --> 00:17:29,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">needs the blood from both of you daily.</font>

313
00:17:30,560 --> 00:17:31,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feared she would refuse,</font>

314
00:17:31,880 --> 00:17:33,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I never told her.</font>

315
00:17:35,280 --> 00:17:36,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You only need to make</font>

316
00:17:36,920 --> 00:17:38,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a small cut on her wrist</font>

317
00:17:38,600 --> 00:17:40,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">while she is asleep every night.</font>

318
00:18:20,120 --> 00:18:21,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After five days,</font>

319
00:18:22,480 --> 00:18:23,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will kill you.</font>

320
00:18:25,270 --> 00:18:27,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

321
00:18:28,150 --> 00:18:29,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

322
00:18:29,810 --> 00:18:33,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

323
00:18:33,730 --> 00:18:38,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

324
00:18:38,420 --> 00:18:41,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

325
00:18:42,400 --> 00:18:46,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

326
00:18:46,920 --> 00:18:51,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

327
00:18:51,260 --> 00:18:56,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

328
00:18:59,390 --> 00:19:03,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

329
00:19:04,060 --> 00:19:07,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

330
00:19:08,110 --> 00:19:12,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

331
00:19:12,660 --> 00:19:15,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

332
00:19:16,630 --> 00:19:20,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

333
00:19:21,240 --> 00:19:25,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
